          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 20
          }
        },
        "text": "**ADEPTUS ASTARTES** model only. In your Shooting phase, you can select one **visible** enemy unit within 18” of this unit. That enemy unit cannot have the **benefit of cover**.",
