      "Stratagem§Armour of Contempt": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Crusaders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\nTARGET: One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Crusader’s Wrath": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Crusaders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Fight phase.\n\nTARGET: One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a melee attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1. If the Suffer Not the Unclean to Live vow is active for your army, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of that attack as well."
      },
      "Stratagem§Devout Push": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Astartes",
            "Vow-sworn Crusaders"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit is selected to make a **pile-in/consolidation move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When making that **pile-in/consolidation move**, your unit can move up to D3+3”."
      },
      "Stratagem§Dread Crusaders": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Astartes",
            "Vow-sworn Crusaders"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, when an enemy unit selects **charge targets**.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit that was selected as a **charge target** by that enemy unit this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** That enemy unit must make a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fervent Acclamation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Crusaders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Your Command phase.\n\nTARGET: One Adeptus Astartes Character unit from your army.\n\nEFFECT: Select one Templar Vow that is not active for your army. Until the start of your next Command phase, while that Character is leading a unit, models in that unit gain the benefits of that vow in addition to the vow selected to be active for your army at the start of the battle"
      },
      "Stratagem§Heresy Begets Retribution": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Astartes",
            "Vow-sworn Crusaders"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8” of a friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **surge move** of up to D6”."
      },
      "Stratagem§No Escape": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Crusaders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit (excluding Vehicles and Monsters) is selected to Fall Back.\n\nTARGET: One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\n\nEFFECT: Roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if the Accept Any Challenge, No Matter the Odds vow is active for your army. On a 4+, that enemy unit cannot Fall Back this phase and must Remain Stationary. Otherwise, that enemy unit can Fall Back this phase, but if it does, all models in that unit must take a Desperate Escape test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pious Enmity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Astartes",
            "Vow-sworn Crusaders"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **CHAPLAIN/JUDICIAR** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAPLIN/JUDICIAR** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit’s melee attacks can re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.\n- __Or:__ Your unit’s melee attacks that target a **MONSTER/VEHICLE** unit can re-roll **hit rolls** of 1 and **wound rolls** of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Spoor of the Unholy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Astartes",
            "Vow-sworn Crusaders"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit is selected to attack.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s: \n- **BS** and **WS**.\n- **Hit rolls**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vicious Riposte": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Crusaders"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\nTARGET: One Adeptus Astartes unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if the Uphold the Honour of the Emperor vow is active for your army. On a 4+, do not remove the destroyed model from play; it can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
