      "Detachment§Fist of the God-Emperor": {
        "text": "**PURGE AND SANCTIFY**\n\nEach time a friendly **CRUSADER SQUAD** unit makes a **surge move**, instead of selecting a **surge target**, you can select the closest **objective** to that unit. When that unit makes that **surge move**, each model in that unit must end that **surge move** as close as possible to that **objective** instead.\n\n**Restrictions:** Your army can include **BLACK TEMPLARS** units, but it cannot include any **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units drawn from any other Chapter.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Take And Hold"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Doctrinal Flexibility"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Angels Defiant"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Avowed Destruction"
              }
            ],
            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        }
      },
      "Detachment§Vow-sworn Crusaders": {
        "text": "**TEMPLAR VOWS**\n\nAt the start of the first battle round, you can select one **Vow** listed below. That **Vow** is active for friendly **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units until the end of the battle. **Abhor the Witch, Destroy the Witch** This unit’s melee attacks that target a **PSYKER** unit: \n- Have **[PRECISION]**.\n- Have **[LANCE]**.**Accept Any Challenge, No Matter the Odds**Friendly melee attacks that target a unit with a **T** greater than this unit’s **S** have +1 to **wound rolls**.**Uphold the Honour of the Emperor**Friendly **INFANTRY** units have: \n- At the end of your Movement phase, if this unit is controlling an **objective**, that **objective** is **secured**.\n- When this unit is selected to make an **advance move**, that **advance move** does not prevent this unit from being **eligible to start an action**.\n\n**Restrictions:** Your army can include **BLACK TEMPLARS** units, but it cannot include any **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units drawn from any other Chapter.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Purge The Foe"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Dread Crusaders"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§For the Emperor's Honour!"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Heresy Begets Retribution"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Spoor of the Unholy"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Stratagem§Pious Enmity"
              },
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{roster}",
                    "traits",
                    "item",
                    "Stratagems§Stratagems",
                    "traits"
