      "Reclaimed Relic§Holy Orb": {
        "stats": {
          "Relic Fragments": {
            "value": 4
          }
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, when you target the bearer’s unit with the Grenade Stratagem, the bearer can use this Reclaimed Relic. If it does, when resolving that Stratagem, 1 mortal wound is inflicted for each roll of 3+ (instead of each roll of 4+), and after resolving that Stratagem, the enemy unit you selected for that Stratagem must take a Battle-shock test.",
