      "Champion's Virtue§Master of Arms": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Champion's Virtue Battle Honours"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Adeptus Astartes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "At the start of the Fight phase, if this model is not leading a unit, until the end of the phase, it has the Fights First ability."
      },
      "Champion's Virtue§Epitome of Piety": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Champion's Virtue Battle Honours"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Adeptus Astartes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model has the Feel No Pain 6+ (this is improved to Feel No Pain 4+ against Psychic Attacks and mortal wounds)."
      },
      "Champion's Virtue§Instrument of the Emperor": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Champion's Virtue Battle Honours"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Adeptus Astartes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a **^^Character^^** model is destroyed by an attack made by this model, you gain 1CP."
      },
      "Champion's Virtue§Adaptable Executioner": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Champion's Virtue Battle Honours"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Adeptus Astartes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model's unit is selected to fight, select the **[LETHAL HITS]** or **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability. Until the end of the phase, this model's Black Sword has that ability."
      },
      "Champion's Virtue§Inspirational Fighter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Champion's Virtue Battle Honours"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Adeptus Astartes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model's unit has fought, if one or more **^^Character^^** models were destroyed as a result of attacks made by this model this phase, until the end of the phase, while a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** unit is within 6\" of this model, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit."
      },
      "Champion's Virtue§Front-line Crusader": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Champion's Virtue Battle Honours"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Adeptus Astartes"
          ]
        },
        "text": "This model has the Scouts 6\" ability, and you can re-roll Charge rolls made for this model's unit."
      },
      "Oath of Crusade§Oath of Crusade": {
        "text": "**Oaths of Crusade** (the Bonus Agenda of every battle in this campaign): select one Deed and one Foe, optionally one Passion and one Condition (choose, or roll a D6 on each table; the Devotional Codicil allows two Passions and two Conditions). The oath reads: ‘In the name of the immortal God-Emperor, I hereby vow to [Deed] [Foe] [Passion] [Condition].’ At the end of the battle, if every part was completed you gain all the listed rewards (+1 Honour point if you rolled the parts); otherwise nothing. Add one Oath of Crusade to this campaign per battle and tick it when completed.\n\n**Deeds:**\n- …bring glory to His name… Completed if you are the victor. Reward: 1 Relic Fragment or 1XP for your WARLORD.\n- …shatter the holdings of the enemy… Completed if you control one or more objective markers in your opponent’s deployment zone. Reward: 2RP or 1 Relic Fragment.\n- …reclaim our holy relics… Completed if you control more objective markers than your opponent. Reward: 2 Relic Fragments.\n\n**Foes:**\n- …and lay low the mightiest tyrants… At the start of the battle select CHARACTER or WARLORD; completed if an ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your Crusade army destroyed an enemy unit with that keyword. Reward: CHARACTER 1 Honour point; WARLORD 2 Honour points and 1 Relic Fragment.\n- …and strike down the most dire foes… At the start of the battle select MONSTER, VEHICLE or TITANIC; completed if an ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit from your Crusade army destroyed an enemy unit with that keyword. Reward: MONSTER/VEHICLE 1 Honour point; TITANIC 2 Honour points and 1 Relic Fragment.\n- …and slaughter the faithless… At the start of the battle select 3 or more units or 6 or more units; completed if that many enemy units were destroyed by ADEPTUS ASTARTES units from your Crusade army. Reward: 3+ → 1 Honour point; 6+ → 2 Honour points and 1 Relic Fragment.\n\n**Passions:**\n- …whilst bearing our artefacts proudly… Completed if one or more ANCIENT or RELIC BEARER units from your Crusade army are wholly within 6\" of the centre of the battlefield. Reward: 1 Honour point.\n- …ere our blades strike at their heart… Completed if one or more CHARACTER units from your Crusade army are wholly within your opponent’s deployment zone. Reward: 1 Honour point.\n- …as righteousness courses through us… Completed if one or more enemy units were destroyed by a CHAPLAIN or JUDICIAR unit from your Crusade army. Reward: 1 Honour point.\n\n**Conditions:**\n- …yet with never a backwards step. Completed if no ADEPTUS ASTARTES units from your Crusade army made a Fall Back move. Reward: 1 Honour point.\n- …in order to keep His domain sanctified. Completed if no enemy units are wholly within your deployment zone. Reward: 1 Honour point.\n- …with the strength to crusade anew. Completed if half or more (rounding down) of the units from your Crusade army are on the battlefield. Reward: 1 Honour point."
      },
      "Requisition§Devotional Codicil": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "When divine portents from the Emperor demand it, the Black Templars commit to ever greater oaths.\n\nPurchase this Requisition at the start of the Select Agendas step. When you are creating your Bonus Agenda for that battle (see below), you can select up to two Passions and up to two Conditions (if you are randomly selecting these and you roll any duplicates, keep rolling until a different result is rolled). You can only purchase this Requisition once per Oathsworn Campaign."
      },
